    description: "<p>**NOTE: This is the proprietary Microsoft build of Visual Studio Code, packaged into a Flatpak. This repackaging is not supported by Microsoft.**</p><p>Visual Studio Code is a new choice of tool that combines the simplicity of a code editor with what developers need for the core edit-build-debug cycle.</p><p>IMPORTANT: To use certain features in this flatpacked version (like the integrated terminal), please read the linked documentation.</p>",
